   <media:title>“Christian Dior’s Night in Color”</media:title>
   <media:content url="https://www.youtube.com/v/G3kIas8ooUQ?version=3" type="application/x-shockwave-flash" width="640" height="390"/>
   <media:thumbnail url="https://i4.ytimg.com/vi/G3kIas8ooUQ/hqdefault.jpg" width="480" height="360"/>
   <media:description>On a snowy winter’s night in 1949, all is quiet at 30 Avenue Montaigne until the phone rings: Marlene Dietrich needs a new dress… What follows is an imaginary adventure through the House, where familiar objects become unexpected characters and a little holiday magic takes hold.

Drawing on Dior’s history, award-winning French director Sylvain Chomet creates an animated film filled with humor and imagination, with Robert Pattinson narrating and a cast of ambassadors and friends lending their voices to an extraordinary night.

Josh O’Connor as The Chair
LaKeith Stanfield as Ron the Director
Louis Garrel as Christian Dior
Nine d’Urso, Greta Lee and Nadia Tereszkiewicz as The Bees
Rihanna as The Star
Camille Cottin as Marlene Dietrich

Discover the full collection: https://www.dior.com/en_int/fashion/gifts/holiday-season?utm_source=youtube&amp;utm_medium=social-owned-branding&amp;utm_campaign=cdc_flg_multi_uniholiday25_uni_gif_202611_

0:00 A quiet night at Dior
1:12 A color emergency
2:16 Seeking inspiration
3:33 Following the stars
5:05 Creating the masterpiece</media:description>
